<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Assessment Invitation - {{assessmentTitle}}</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .assessment-card {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        
        .assessment-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        
        .assessment-details {
            display: grid;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .detail-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
        
        .detail-item strong {
            color: #374151;
            margin-right: 8px;
            min-width: 80px;
        }
        
        .detail-icon {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            margin-right: 8px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }
        
        .assessment-description {
            color: #4b5563;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .instruction {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }
        
        .instruction h3 {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .instruction p {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .secondary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            color: #374151;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-left: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        }
        
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        
        .footer p {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .footer a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .urgency-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .deadline-warning {
            background-color: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            color: #dc2626;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .deadline-warning h3 {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .deadline-warning p {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            
            .header, .content, .footer {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            
            .assessment-details {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .cta-button, .secondary-button {
                display: block;
                margin: 12px 0;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎯 Assessment Invitation</h1>
            <p>You've been invited to take an assessment</p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">
                Hello {{userName}},
            </div>
            
            <p>You have been invited to participate in an assessment. This is an important opportunity to showcase your skills and knowledge.</p>
            
            <!-- Urgency Badge -->
            {{#if endDate}}
            <div class="urgency-badge">
                ⏰ Deadline: {{formatDate endDate}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <!-- Assessment Card -->
            <div class="assessment-card">
                <div class="assessment-title">{{assessmentTitle}}</div>
                
                {{#if assessmentDescription}}
                <div class="assessment-description">
                    {{assessmentDescription}}
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                
                <div class="assessment-details">
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Type:</strong>
                        <span>{{assessmentType}}</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Duration:</strong>
                        <span>{{duration}} minutes</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    {{#if totalMarks}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Total Marks:</strong>
                        <span>{{totalMarks}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if totalQuestions}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Questions:</strong>
                        <span>{{totalQuestions}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if startDate}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Start Date:</strong>
                        <span>{{formatDate startDate}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if endDate}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>End Date:</strong>
                        <span>{{formatDate endDate}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if collegeName}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>College:</strong>
                        <span>{{collegeName}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if courseName}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Course:</strong>
                        <span>{{courseName}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                    
                    {{#if year}}
                    <div class="detail-item">
                        <strong>Year:</strong>
                        <span>{{year}}</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Instructions -->
            {{#if instruction}}
            <div class="instruction">
                <h3>📋 Important Instructions</h3>
                <p>{{instruction}}</p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <!-- Deadline Warning -->
            {{#if endDate}}
            <div class="deadline-warning">
                <h3>⚠️ Important</h3>
                <p>Please complete this assessment before the deadline. Late submissions may not be accepted.</p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <!-- Call to Action -->
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{assessmentUrl}}" class="cta-button">
                    🚀 Start Assessment
                </a>
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="secondary-button">
                    📊 View Dashboard
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Additional Information -->
            <div style="margin-top: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px;">
                <h3 style="color: #374151; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px;">💡 Tips for Success</h3>
                <ul style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Ensure you have a stable internet connection</li>
                    <li>Find a quiet environment to take the assessment</li>
                    <li>Read all instructions carefully before starting</li>
                    <li>Manage your time effectively during the assessment</li>
                    <li>Review your answers before submitting</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact our support team.</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{appUrl}}">Visit {{appName}}</a> | 
                <a href="{{helpUrl}}">Help Center</a> | 
                <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">Contact Support</a>
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 16px;">
                This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
